  "project_description": "This module provides a views filter for the Range module's range_integer field.\n\n By default the filter provided by the Range module can be used to search for a single number inside the ranges. \n\n The filter implemented in this module however provides a min and a max that can be used to find ranges that are overlapping with the range defined by the given values.",
